---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Recovery Numbers"
  description="Recovery Numbers privacy policy. We do not collect or store any data you enter into our calculators."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Last updated: October 2026</p>
  </section>

  <div class="card" style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h2>No data collection</h2>
    <p>Recovery Numbers does not collect, transmit, or store any data you enter into our calculators. All calculations run entirely in your browser. No form input leaves your device.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We may collect aggregate, anonymous page-view data (e.g., which pages are visited, approximate geographic region) using a privacy-respecting analytics provider. This data contains no personally identifiable information and cannot be linked back to individual users.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a single first-party cookie or <code>localStorage</code> entry to remember your dark/light mode preference. No tracking cookies or third-party advertising cookies are set.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>We display contextual advertisements. Ad networks may set their own cookies subject to their privacy policies. We do not share your personal data with advertisers.</p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>Our site may link to external resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party sites.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Use the feedback link in the site footer.</p>
    <!-- TODO: add contact method when available -->
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
